<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-817] Elasticsearch : an error is displayed when there is a &apos;fields&apos; field in a search query</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-817</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Example of query :&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;gt; search / {&quot;fields&quot;:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;&amp;quot;date&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;request.headers&amp;quot;&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;,&quot;query&quot;:{&quot;match&quot;:&lt;/p&gt;
{&quot;status&quot;:404}
&lt;p&gt;}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With this query, we have the following result: &quot;Error : string is null&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
